bout dos au mur, genoux souples, placez les bras au côté avec coudes fléchis et avant-bras au mur.","execution":"Montez les bras en gardant les contacts confortables au mur. Redescendez les bras sur le même trajet.","finish":"Relâchez les bras et avancez pour quitter le mur."},"en":{"setup":"Stand back to the wall with soft knees, bent elbows and forearms against it.","execution":"Slide the arms upward while retaining comfortable wall contacts. Lower the arms along the same path.","finish":"Relax your arms and step away."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Une répétition = aller et retour complets dans la configuration indiquée.","en":"One repetition = one complete outward-and-return cycle in the stated setup."},"load":{"fr":"Aucune charge externe ajoutée; aucune conversion de pression ou de traction en force.","en":"No added external load; pressure or traction is not converted into force."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"not_applicable"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"MO_062","pilot":{"sourceId":"MO_062","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.1.0-coverage.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Automassage des adducteurs au rouleau en appui sur les avant-bras","en":"Prone bent-knee adductor foam rolling"},"equipment":{"id":"foam_roller","labels":{"fr":"Rouleau de massage","en":"Foam roller"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Ventre vers le sol, appuyez-vous sur les avant-bras et placez la cuisse droite ouverte, genou fléchi, sur le rouleau.","execution":"Déplacez doucement le corps pour faire rouler la zone charnue interne de la cuisse. Revenez sur le même trajet sans passer sur le genou ni l’aine.","finish":"Déchargez le rouleau avant de retirer la jambe."},"en":{"setup":"Lie prone on the forearms with the open right thigh and bent knee on the roller.","execution":"Move gently to roll along the muscular inner thigh. Return along the same path without rolling the knee or groin.","finish":"Unload the roller before removing the leg."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Une répétition = aller et retour complets dans la configuration indiquée.","en":"One repetition = one complete outward-and-return cycle in the stated setup."},"load":{"fr":"Aucune charge externe ajoutée; aucune conversion de pression ou de traction en force.","en":"No added external load; pressure or traction is not converted into force."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"not_applicable"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"PL_017","pilot":{"sourceId":"PL_017","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.1.0-coverage.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Skipping bondissant","en":"Power skip"},"equipment":{"id":"plyometric","labels":{"fr":"Pliométrie et agilité","en":"Plyometrics and agility"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Debout, avancez dans le couloir avec bras libres.","execution":"Posez le pied droit puis rebondissez sur ce pied en relevant le genou gauche, pointe relevée, et le bras droit. Reprenez l’appui droit puis passez au pied gauche pour répéter le pas-saut opposé.","finish":"Diminuez les rebonds vers une marche avant l’arrêt."},"en":{"setup":"Stand and move into the clear lane with free arms.","execution":"Step onto the right foot, then hop from it as the left knee and right arm rise, with the left toe up. Land on the right foot, then step onto the left for the opposite step-hop.","finish":"Reduce the rebounds to walking before stopping."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Une répétition = pas-saut sur un pied; compter chaque côté.","en":"One repetition = one step-hop on one foot; count each side."},"load":{"fr":"Aucune charge externe ajoutée; aucune conversion de pression ou de traction en force.","en":"No added external load; pressure or traction is not converted into force."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"not_applicable"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"PL_019","pilot":{"sourceId":"PL_019","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.1.0-coverage.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Déplacement carioca","en":"Carioca crossover run"},"equipment":{"id":"plyometric","labels":{"fr":"Pliométrie et agilité","en":"Plyometrics and agility"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Debout face à l’avant, prévoyez un déplacement vers la droite.","execution":"Croisez le pied gauche devant le droit puis ouvrez le pied droit vers la droite. Croisez le pied gauche derrière le droit puis ouvrez de nouveau à droite.","finish":"Ralentissez le motif puis retrouvez deux appuis avant de vous arrêter."},"en":{"setup":"Face forward with a clear path to the right.","execution":"Cross the left foot in front of the right, then step the right foot to the right. Cross the left behind the right, then step the right outward again.","finish":"Slow the pattern and settle on both feet before stopping."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Une répétition = devant, ouverture, derrière, ouverture; noter sens et distance.","en":"One repetition = front cross, open, back cross, open; record direction and distance."},"load":{"fr":"Aucune charge externe ajoutée; aucune conversion de pression ou de traction en force.","en":"No added external load; pressure or traction is not converted into force."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"not_applicable"}},"default_unit":"lb"}]$coverage_seed$::jsonb)
as x(source_id text,pilot jsonb,default_unit text);
do $coverage_check$ begin
 if exists(select 1 from coverage_seed s join app_private.training_pilot_catalog c on c.source_id=s.source_id and c.source_version=s.pilot->>'sourceVersion'
   where c.pilot is distinct from s.pilot or c.default_unit is distinct from s.default_unit) then
   raise exception 'FE_COVERAGE_IDENTITY_CONFLICT';
 end if;
end $coverage_check$;
insert into app_private.training_pilot_catalog(source_id,pilot,default_unit)
select source_id,pilot,default_unit from coverage_seed on conflict(source_id,source_version) do nothing;
commit;
